@coloradonativeguide Thank you for sharing your concerns, and we are very sorry if our video caused you any discomfort or made you feel that your work was not respected.

We have great respect for creators and the time and effort they put into producing original footage. If there is a specific piece of footage that you believe belongs to you, please let us know the timestamp or send us a link to the original video.

We will review it carefully, and if we are indeed at fault, we will do our best to rectify it. Thank you for taking the time to watch our video.
